    <item>
      <title>Coming to XBOX Game Pass: EA Sports FC 26, RV There Yet?, Winds of Arcana: Ruination, and More - XBOX Wire</title>
      <link>https://adamofsound.github.io/gaming-hub/xbox/2026-07-25-coming-to-xbox-game-pass-ea-sports-fc-26-rv-there-yet-winds-of-arcana-ruination-and-more-xbox-wire/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 25 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://adamofsound.github.io/gaming-hub/xbox/2026-07-25-coming-to-xbox-game-pass-ea-sports-fc-26-rv-there-yet-winds-of-arcana-ruination-and-more-xbox-wire/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;I hope you all enjoyed the XBOX Games Showcase; we had dozens of games and updates, many of them with the “Play It Day One with XBOX Game Pass” badge! While you’re waiting for those games to come your way, let’s get to what you can play next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Junkster (Cloud, XBOX Series X|S, Handheld, and PC) – June 16
Game Pass Ultimate, PC Game Pass&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Available day one on XBOX Game Pass! Junkster is a 3D action platformer with an awesome building mechanic. Plucky, little construction bot, UM-13 (or Um for short) has crashed on a dangerous junkyard planet. Armed only with his trusty robo-wrench, Um must repair his ship and recover his lost cargo of precious human artifacts.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
